Thank you for your purchase! 
Follow these 3 simple steps to load your indicator in 30 seconds:

STEP 1: Open TradingView
- Go to https://www.tradingview.com and open any chart (BTC, AAPL, etc.).

STEP 2: Open Pine Editor
- Click on "Pine Editor" at the bottom or the curly braces "{ }" on your screen.
- Clear any default code inside the editor.

STEP 3: Paste & Save
- Copy the entire Pine Script code below.
- Paste it into the Pine Editor.
- Click "Add to chart" and "Save".

That's it! Your dynamic TP/SL levels, non-repainting buy/sell signals, 
and institutional dashboard are now live on your chart.

